i18n: fix garbled Hebrew text in Oscar / Victory ribbon overlays

The OscarPopup forced `direction: ltr` on the whole overlay so the
ribbon tails kept the right flex order, but that also flipped the
bidi rendering of the Hebrew quip text: punctuation jumped to the
wrong side and embedded Latin names (actor/director) appeared
reversed.

Scope the LTR override to the ribbon decoration itself (where the
forked left/right tails actually need a fixed order) and let the
quip / sub paragraphs inherit the page direction. Apply the same
fix to the Victory ribbon.

Bumps PWA cache to v1.16.1.
